{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Lock a container to prevent removal or upgrades {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter lk   [options] [container]{R}                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter lock [options] [container]{R}                {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter lk my-box{R}                                 {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter lk my-box --root{R}                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter lock my-box{R}                               {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter lock my-box --root{R}                        {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     {2}┆{R} {4}-a{R}  {5}Lock all otter containers{R}        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-r{R}  {5}Lock a rootful container{R}         {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                         {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}           {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Locked containers are skipped by 'remove' and{R}    {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}'upgrade'. Use 'otter unlock' to reverse.{R}        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Container must be running to lock.{R}               {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Already locked containers are skipped.{R}           {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ See also:{R}                                       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Lock state is stored inside the container at{R}     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}/usr/lib/otter/container.lock{R}                    {2}│{R}
{2}╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────╯{R}
